{"id":"demasiado","lemma":"demasiado","pos":"adv","rank":185,"glosses":["too much, excessively, far too much, overmuch (modifying a verb)","too, far too, way too, much too, overly, all too excessively (modifying an adjective or other adverb)","a lot, an awful lot, a whole lot, a great deal"],"ipa":"/demaˈsjado/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-demasiado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto parece demasiado fácil.","en":"This seems too easy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449292","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},null,{"g":"easy, facile, simple"}]},{"text":"Entonces será demasiado tarde.","en":"It'll be too late then.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44516","words":[{"g":"then"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"¿Es esto demasiado grande?","en":"Is this too big?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441935","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"big, large"}]},{"text":"Puede que sea demasiado viejo.","en":"I may be too old.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50853","words":[null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"old person"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"it may be that"]]},{"text":"Trabajas demasiado duro.","en":"You work too hard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450732","words":[{"g":"to work","l":"trabajar"},null,{"g":"hard"}]}]}